          "chunk_id": "s05_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c1_uni_mask_represents_trajectory_seque",
          "text": "Uni-MASK represents a trajectory as a sequence of per-timestep tokens: a state, an action, and optionally a property token such as return-to-go, the sum of future rewards.",
