          "chunk_id": "s05_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c2_masking_scheme_specifies_two_things",
          "text": "A masking scheme specifies two things: which input tokens are visible to the model, and which output tokens the model must predict and be scored on. Different schemes recover different tasks.",
